flowchart TD
    User([Клиент / PWA])
    Printer([Печатник, тонкий клиент])
    Cashier([Кассир, POS])
    Admin([Администратор сети])

    GW[API Gateway]
    IDP[Identity Service]
    DOC[Document Service]
    ED[Editor Service]
    TPL[Template Service]
    STO[Storage Service]
    PO[Print Order Service]
    SH[Shop Service]
    PAY[Payment Service]
    NT[Notification Service]
    BI[Admin / BI Service]
    AUD[Audit Service]

    User -->|sync HTTPS| GW
    User -.->|sync WebSocket| ED
    Printer --> GW
    Cashier --> GW
    Admin --> GW

    GW -->|sync gRPC| IDP
    GW --> DOC
    GW --> TPL
    GW --> PO
    GW --> SH
    GW --> PAY
    GW --> BI

    ED -->|async Kafka| DOC
    ED -->|async Kafka| STO
    DOC --> STO
    TPL --> STO
    PO -->|sync gRPC| SH
    PO -->|sync gRPC| PAY
    PO -.->|async Kafka| Printer
    PAY -->|sync HTTPS| OFD([ОФД])
    PAY -.->|sync HTTPS| BANK([Банк / СБП])

    DOC -.->|async Kafka| NT
    PO -.->|async Kafka| NT
    PAY -.->|async Kafka| NT
    NT -.->|email / SMS / push| User

    DOC -.->|async Kafka| AUD
    PO -.->|async Kafka| AUD
    PAY -.->|async Kafka| AUD
    IDP -.->|async Kafka| AUD